OL,3,GNEWSA'Dreadful' rapist abused girls in
OL,4,Ahis car for cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "dreadful" paedophile who gave money
OL,7,Fto two young vulnerable teenage girls
OL,8,Fafter he repeatedly raped them in his
OL,9,Fcar has been jailed for 15 years.
OL,11,FPaul Black, 36, first met the victims,
OL,12,Fwho were aged 13 and 14, online and
OL,13,Fwent on to rape them on multiple
OL,14,Foccasions after driving them to an
OL,15,Findustrial estate, Teesside Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FThe girls said they had been targeted
OL,19,Ffor their vulnerability, while a judge
OL,20,Fsaid Black took advantage of the
OL,21,F"impressionable young girls".
